#: ../../../async-programming/overlapping-transfers-and-compute.md:98
msgid "Practical tradeoffs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../async-programming/overlapping-transfers-and-compute.md:100
msgid ""
"Pinning consumes limited host memory, and copying pageable input into a "
"staging buffer is not free. Reuse a small ring of buffers and profile the "
"copy engines before increasing the number of streams."
msgstr ""

